# W7c, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; its link is cut (a half-open cut: the proxy holds a's packets for 20 s without closing; the grace starts within 5 s, no lagOut, a resumes).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until epoch>=@235
log a back
wander -150 -60 20 until sealed>=3000 fail stage=stagml11
log a played on as host
